1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,340
Now this one's for the fathers, the ones who showed us how

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:05,780
To stand in front of those we love, and I can see them now

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:09,860
They worked from dark to dark and never once went asking for the praise

4
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:13,700
And they held the roof above our heads through all the leanest days

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:17,380
They taught us that a real man is the shelter, not the storm

6
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:21,000
He's the one out in the cold so the ones he loves stay warm
